#! ia 1.0

@schema operation
  lowers to binding
  sections
    must have meaning
    must have execution
    may have relationships
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    must have meaning.answers as text
    must have execution.handler as id
    must have execution.effects as id
    must have execution.input as id
    must have execution.output as id
    may have execution.profile as id
    may have execution.recovery as id
